{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106512","id":2525426345,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6WhvKp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106512","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106512.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106512.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106512","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106512/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106512/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106512/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6f1490bfa1c5b84ea7dd48e1528e92660c72829f","number":106512,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Obfuscate the AES encryption key","user":{"login":"bearlikelion","id":3298808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTg4MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3298808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion","html_url":"https://github.com/bearlikelion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Right now, a big complaint I see online about Godot is it's security.  After a hacker infected my game's leaderboards, I took some steps to rotate and secure my AES encryption key.\r\n\r\nI frequently here the complaint:\r\n\r\n> \"even encrypting your PCK is trivial.\" \r\n\r\nShown by [this tutorial](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fWjuFmYGoSY), AES Encryption Keys are essential a ctrl+f away from being discovered in compiled binaries.\r\n\r\nMy proposal is to remove the identifiable strings in the release template and use a XOR Cipher to obfuscate the key in the compiled binary.\r\n\r\n# Generating a XOR Bitmask\r\n`openssl rand -hex 1 > ~/.config/godot/godot.mask`\r\n**Example:** 1F\r\n\r\n~/.bashrc\r\n`export GODOT_XOR_BITMASK=$(cat \"$HOME/.config/godot/godot.mask\")`\r\n\r\nYou'll need to compile your own export templates with this environment variable set, but this will generate a new `script_encryption_key.gen.cpp` with an obfuscated key as the constructor. The remaining parts of the engine that call the key remain the same.\r\n\r\nThis isn't meant to **stop your key from being revealed** but makes it _much more difficult to find_.\r\n\r\nI created a minimal reproducible project with exported binaries here: https://github.com/bearlikelion/godotxor\r\nThe AES Key for the project is: `aa806faf0a80b29b1893d351da03a61facd2181a7522a991b426050aa7534951`\r\n\r\nI am looking for feedback on this type of security and to potentially merge it into the engine to help others secure their games.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nMark","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TG